  "description": "The OXVA Xlim Go 2 is a simple, dependable pod vape kit built for everyday use. A 1500mAh built-in battery supports automatic power adjustment up to 30W, while inhale activation keeps operation straightforward. An airflow slider lets you fine-tune the draw to suit MTL or RDL styles. The kit includes a refillable 2ml Xlim V3 top-fill pod with a built-in 0.8ohm mesh coil for clear flavour and easy maintenance. The device is also compatible with Xlim EZ pods, giving you a broader choice of coil options across MTL and RDL. A three-colour battery indicator provides charge feedback at a glance. When it’s time to top up, USB-C charging helps you get back to vaping quickly (cable not included). We Recommend paring the kit with 50/50 , Nic Salt or High PG E-Liquid Shop our vape juice collection to find flavours that go hand in hand with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
